## Admin-record source-authentication test - Node 1 (source / report-to).
## Leaves admin-record authentication at its secure default (require), so a
## status signal from a node that is not a recognized peer is ignored until
## the operator authorizes that source with 'm adminauth allow'.
1
a scheme ipn 'ipnfw' 'ipnadminep'
a endpoint ipn:1.0 x
a endpoint ipn:1.1 x
a endpoint ipn:1.2 x
a protocol udp 1400 100
a induct udp 127.0.0.1:4551 udpcli
a outduct udp 127.0.0.1:4552 udpclo
r 'ipnadmin node.ipnrc'
m srmode compressed
m cbraggr 1 1 2
s
